// Prebuilt applications of the device.
//
// Only the project's own MovieLauncher is imported here. Its APK is a build
// output of launcher/ (Gradle) and is NOT stored in git: build it first and
// copy it to this directory as MovieLauncher.apk (launcher/README.md).
//
// Third-party launchers are deliberately absent from public builds:
//   * Google LeanbackLauncher 2.8 (2016) is proprietary;
//   * Monet-Launcher (github.com/Klevico/Monet-Launcher), which the
//     maintainer's unit used, publishes no licence.
// Users who want either install it themselves after first boot.
//
// Input: the UNSIGNED Gradle release output (app-release-unsigned.apk).
// Neither presigned nor preprocessed: the AOSP build zip-aligns it and signs
// it with the build's default key, like the rest of the image (test-keys in a
// developer build). Importing an unsigned APK as presigned would install a
// package that the device rejects.
// overrides: Launcher3QuickStep from the base AOSP profile crash-loops on
// this TV build (no widget service), so it must not be installed.
android_app_import {
    name: "MovieLauncher",
    apk: "MovieLauncher.apk",
    overrides: [
        "Launcher3QuickStep",
        "Launcher3",
    ],
    dex_preopt: {
        enabled: false,
    },
}
